  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "C1",
      "text": "Public NCV Level 2 past question papers and memoranda for the exam subjects are downloadable online: mytvet.co.za lists QP+Memo pairs per subject (e.g. Mechatronic Systems L2, 2015-2025) and edupstairs.org indexes official DHET/NOLS exam sittings.",
      "type": "FACT"
    },
    {
      "id": "C2",
      "text": "The exam subject set (Introduction to Computers, Electrotechnology, Manual Manufacturing, Mechatronic Systems, Life Skills and Computer Literacy, English FAL, Mathematics at Level 2) corresponds to the NC(V) Level 2 Mechatronics programme.",
      "type": "FACT"
    },
    {
      "id": "C3",
      "text": "The Department of Higher Education and Training's NOLS repository is the official publication channel for TVET exam question papers and memoranda.",
      "type": "FACT"
    },
    {
      "id": "C4",
      "text": "The notebook.google.com notebook URLs in notebooks.txt require Google sign-in: an unauthenticated automated fetch is redirected to accounts.google.com sign-in.",
      "type": "FACT"
    },
    {
      "id": "C5",
      "text": "Past NSC/matric question papers and memoranda are published by the South African Department of Basic Education and are publicly downloadable.",
      "type": "FACT"
    },
    {
      "id": "C6",
      "text": "NotebookLM gates notebook access behind Google sign-in: unauthenticated clients are redirected to accounts.google.com, while a signed-in session (Edge + CDP debug port) returns full content for all 17 notebook.google.com URLs in notebooks.txt; the author-flagged cant share annotations mean not-link-sharable to anonymous clients, not inaccessible to the signed-in account.",
      "type": "FACT"
    },
    {
      "id": "C7",
      "text": "Deep source extraction completed for all 17 authenticated notebooks: the notebooklm-ingestion extension walked 76/76 sources, capturing 1,363,766 characters of source text (docx/text sources), 449 rendered PDF page images and 65 per-source Gemini summaries; 17 hashed JSON captures (sha256-verified against research/captures/notebooklm_sources/manifest.json with 0 mismatches) were ingested as 17 data/notebooks/*.sources.txt files, growing the search index to 34 documents.",
      "type": "FACT"
    }
  ],
